nd visible. Her head should be near the top of the frame with a small amount of headroom. The bicycle should be partially visible, including the handlebars and upper frame, with the wheels extending outside the image boundaries. Keep the camera close to the woman rather than showing the entire bicycle or a distant full-body shot.\n\nMaintain realistic anatomy, natural cycling posture, accurate proportions, and physically believable interaction with the bicycle. Seamlessly integrate the woman into the park environment with consistent natural lighting, shadows, and perspective. Photorealistic photography.","venera_qwen2511_test_v1_000001000.safetensors",1,"changed face, different face, different person, altered identity, different hair, different breasts, small breasts, firm breasts, perky breasts, smaller breasts, different nipples, cartoon, anime, 3d render, stylized, plastic skin, extra fingers, deformed hands, watermark, text, logo, low quality, blurry, skeleton, stick figure, colored lines, dots, keypoints, wide shot, distant subject, small face, full body shot",831664328843378,"qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8mixed.safetensors","qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors","qwen_image_vae.safetensors",false,"Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors"]},{"id":477,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[-380,520],"size":[400,520],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":753}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":null}],"title":"Rendered skeleton","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.0","Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":478,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[-380,1080],"size":[400,500],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"choose file to upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"ou